{"nodes": [{"id": "profiles_qa_readme_quickfill_qa", "label": "Jira QuickFill QA", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_jira_rest_api_v3", "label": "Tudo por API REST v3 do Jira", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L9-L22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nada de clicar em campos na tela, ent\u00e3o mudan\u00e7as de layout do Jira n\u00e3o quebram a extens\u00e3o."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_lote", "label": "Lote (espa\u00e7os MEED e SUS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L186-L215", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Status no lote casado por nome, n\u00e3o por id de transi\u00e7\u00e3o, porque ids mudam entre workflows; falha em uma subtarefa nunca aborta o lote."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_colunas_do_quadro", "label": "Selecionar pelas colunas do quadro", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L217-L243", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nome da coluna quase nunca \u00e9 igual ao do status; l\u00ea /rest/agile/1.0/board/{id}/configuration para obter ids de status de cada coluna."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_criar_subtarefa_testes_manuais", "label": "Criar subtarefa Testes Manuais", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L245-L267", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tipo de subtarefa descoberto pela flag subtask (n\u00e3o pelo nome, que varia por idioma); n\u00e3o duplica; atribui\u00e7\u00e3o com fallback por PUT /assignee."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_jornada_de_trabalho", "label": "Jornada de trabalho (11:00\u201317:00, teto 6h)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L269-L322", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes o hor\u00e1rio era 09:00 UTC fixo, que no Brasil ca\u00eda \u00e0s 06:00; agora encaixa sem sobreposi\u00e7\u00e3o no fuso do navegador."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_story_points_fibonacci", "label": "Story points (Fibonacci)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L324-L334", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_meu_dia", "label": "Meu dia (meta 4h, teto 6h)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L336-L349", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_formato_tempo_mhd", "label": "Formato de tempo M \u00b7 H \u00b7 D (1d = 6h)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L351-L364", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Envia sempre horas e minutos ao Jira, nunca 'd', sen\u00e3o o Jira usaria o expediente dele (geralmente 8h)."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_equipe_ao_vivo", "label": "Equipe ao vivo (a cada 30 s)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L48-L98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_pausa_rate_limit", "label": "Pausa autom\u00e1tica do Jira (429 e backoff 1/2/5 min)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L74-L86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Para n\u00e3o pesar no Jira: uma busca incremental por issues alteradas, nunca duas consultas simult\u00e2neas, espera o tempo pedido e marca 'dados parciais' em vez de sumir da soma."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_painel_minhas_demandas", "label": "Painel (minhas demandas) e cart\u00f5es de Sprint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L100-L155", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_rascunho_storage_session", "label": "Rascunho em chrome.storage.session", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L372-L388", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O popup do Chrome \u00e9 destru\u00eddo ao perder o foco; o rascunho nunca vai para o disco e expira em 12h para n\u00e3o aplicar datas de ontem."}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_voltar_de_onde_parou", "label": "Voltar de onde parou (3.11)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L437-L442", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_aba_validacao", "label": "Aba Valida\u00e7\u00e3o (fila do QA)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L466-L467", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_evidencia_de_teste", "label": "Evid\u00eancia de teste / retorno ao DEV (etiqueta retorno-<categoria>)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L468-L470", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_filtro_espaco", "label": "Filtro Espa\u00e7o (Todos \u00b7 MEED \u00b7 SUS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "profiles/qa/README.md", "source_location": "L446-L453", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "profiles_qa_readme_etapas_do_quadro", "label": "Etapas do quadro (Impedido/Aguardando,